{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this visual novel you\u2019ll find out: how dangerous white sauce can be, what humanization of shawarma looks like, whose yelling is heard on the streets of Samara at night, and what secrets hide within the kitchens of elite shawarma shops.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >WHERE THE STORY BEGINS...</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2635980/extras/812d82374cafa9b183f817151aa0dd02.poster.avif?t=1763795929\" width=600 height=382 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2635980/extras/812d82374cafa9b183f817151aa0dd02.webm?t=1763795929\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2635980/extras/812d82374cafa9b183f817151aa0dd02.mp4?t=1763795929\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Episode 2: Fear and Loathing in Samara</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gray days, work, depression... Sometimes it feels like there's nothing that can make you happy. Only shawarma can help chase away the sorrow and bring back the colors of the world.  But what to do if you suddenly find out that your favorite shawarma shop is open for one final day? </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Episode 3: Bring Me that Shawarma</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Roman is an ordinary courier from not the most prestigious food delivery company. Lately, strange things have been happening in the city: animals have begun to behave differently and the people around them seem to be in a sinister conspiracy. Will our protagonist be able to deliver the shawarma and still stay alive?</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>You can find a full description of each episode in the game.</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >6 MAIN AND 2 BONUS EPISODES ARE AVAILABLE NOW</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2635980/extras/7d875cc32b3c6b937fd656286825b14b.avif?t=1763795929\" width=616 height=760 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An episodic visual novel within the same universe consisting of these genres: thrash, comedy, aliens, horror, thriller and some food horror/body horror </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >High-quality anime-style graphics combined with real-life photos and environments</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An anxious dark atmosphere, which will be conveyed to the player through unusual sounds and visual effects</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Screen resolution 1440x1080 px (4:3 aspect ratio)</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2635980/extras/335841d5e16bb4059da1741a8fc90f04.avif?t=1763795929\" width=600 height=260 /></span></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Cringe Stories","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2635980/7a15b19bdd869134696a6f6e7654b9f7316a0ecd.jpg"},{"name":"Fear and Loathing in Samara","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2635980/6c776ff45b111a2f440f0cb97a797cfa34c9d1d4.jpg"},{"name":"Bring Me that Shawarma","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2635980/f6c67e5cb9b622d63a462ec5de4b5c9a4c7a25f7.jpg"},{"name":"White Blood","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2635980/60fb87f168c8d472c6a22d6103a8a172a48c6d61.jpg"},{"name":"Lazy Shawarma","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steam